DESCRIPTION:<p><p>Peak is fast approaching and the holiday shopping season 
 will soon be here!</p>\n<p>Are you ready to lead the next wave of growth th
 is year and win this Q4?</p>\n<p>Join our exclusive &lsquo\;AI-Powered Peak
 &rsquo\; webinar to unlock the tactics and tools you need to power your mar
 keting strategy in 2025.</p></p>\n<p>Join session <a href="https://accelera
 te.google/intl/en/library/ai-powered-peak-growth-jul-uki?utm_source=event_d
 ownload&amp\;utm_medium=calendar" target="_blank" rel="noopener">here</a></
 p>\n<p>If you have any questions\, please contact <a href="mailto:questions
 -accelerate-with-google-emea@google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">que
 stions-accelerate-with-google-emea@google.com</a></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250626T213519Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
