 STS=0:mailto:iam@peterpohanka.com
CREATED:20250619T191258Z
DESCRIPTION:AI is rapidly reshaping the modern development workflow – from 
 brainstorming and architecture to writing tests and debugging. In this hand
 s-on workshop\, we’ll explore how large language models (LLMs) are becoming
  indispensable tools for full-stack developers. You’ll learn not just <i da
 ta-stringify-type="italic">what</i> AI can do\, but <i data-stringify-type=
 "italic">how</i> to integrate it thoughtfully and effectively into your own
  applications.\n\nOver the course of six hours\, we’ll move through structu
 red cycles of instruction\, live coding\, challenges\, and solution walkthr
 oughs. You’ll gain practical experience and walk away with a fully function
 ing AI-powered web app.
LAST-MODIFIED:20250708T133205Z
LOCATION:Online
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:AI-Driven Development: Building Smarter Web Apps with LLMs
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20250715T090000Z
DTEND:20250715T100000Z
DTSTAMP:20251031T072219Z
UID:2ql56v001p36ppg7klqlqu29nq@google.com
CREATED:20250708T135118Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><p><span data-sheets-root="1">As an advertiser or marketing 
 specialist\, you're navigating a digital landscape that's constantly shifti
 ng\, especially with evolving privacy regulations like GDPR across EMEA. Th
 e good news? The key to thriving lies in your most valuable asset: first-pa
 rty data (1PD). Join us for this essential Google bootcamp\, led by Online 
 Marketing Specialist Christina Brauer\, and discover how to transform your 
 1PD into a powerful engine for growth.<br /><br />In an AI-first world\, yo
 ur AI is only as good as the data you feed it. This bootcamp will equip you
  with strategies and tools to leverage your 1PD\, driving superior campaign
  performance and accurate measurement\, even amidst signal loss. We'll show
  you how Google's solutions specifically address the unique challenges of t
 he EMEA region\, helping you unlock new insights while staying compliant.<b
 r /><br />Here's what to expect:<br /></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-she
 ets-root="1"><strong>Master the 1PD Advantage:</strong> Understand why 1PD 
 is crucial for boosting revenue and how it powers Google AI for incredible 
 cost efficiency.<br /><br /></span></li>\n<li><span data-sheets-root="1"><s
 trong>Smarter Audiences with Customer Match:</strong> Learn how Customer Ma
 tch helps you build more effective audiences\, with key insights into EEA c
 onsent signal requirements for your lists.<br /><br /></span></li>\n<li><sp
 an data-sheets-root="1"><strong>Integrate 1PD with AI-Powered Campaigns:</s
 trong> Discover how to seamlessly combine your data with Google's advanced 
 AI solutions.<br /><br /></span></li>\n<li><span data-sheets-root="1"><stro
 ng>Enhanced Conversions for Better Measurement: </strong>See how this criti
 cal tool provides vital data for AI models\, improving observability and in
 creasing reported conversions\, especially when paired with Consent Mode to
  navigate cookie consent challenges.<br /><br /></span></li>\n<li><span dat
 a-sheets-root="1"><strong>Q&amp\;A session sharing Best Practices</strong>:
  We'll share our top tips to maximise your results and confidently navigate
  the privacy landscape across EMEA.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span data-sheet
 s-root="1">This bootcamp is a must-attend for any advertiser or marketing s
 pecialist ready to future-proof their strategy\, boost performance with pre
 cise targeting\, and get a real edge with reliable measurement in this AI-f
 irst marketing era. Don't miss out on transforming your approach to digital
  advertising!<br /></span></p></p>\n<p>Join session <a href="https://accele
 rate.google/intl/en/library/google-ai-summer-bootcamp-mastering-measurement
 -in-ai-first-world-day-1-jul?utm_source=event_download&amp\;utm_medium=cale
 ndar" target="_blank" rel="noopener">here</a></p>\n<p>If you have any quest
 ions\, please contact <a href="mailto:questions-accelerate-with-google-emea
 @google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">questions-accelerate-with-googl
 e-emea@google.com</a></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250708T135118Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Google - Google AI Summer Bootcamp: Mastering Measurement in an AI-
 First World
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
