DESCRIPTION:Topic: Introducing SQL Developer Copilot Integration in Microso
 ft VSCode and MCP Support for Oracle Database\nDescription: Join us live to
  get a first look at two major innovations for Oracle Database developers:\
 n\nSQL Developer integration with Microsoft Copilot for VSCode\n- Superchar
 ge your workflow with intelligent assistance for Oracle Database 23ai. Lear
 n how Microsoft Copilot boosts productivity with code suggestions\, auto-co
 mpletion\, and support for advanced features like AI Vector Search\, Proper
 ty Graphs\, the Multilingual Engine for JavaScript\, Duality Views\, and th
 e upcoming APEXLang. It also helps streamline code reviews and documentatio
 n—making it easier to write and maintain high-quality code.\n\nSQLcl Model 
 Context Protocol (MCP) Server for Oracle Database\n- Discover a new\, AI-po
 wered way to interact with Oracle Database. The MCP Server enables natural 
 language interactions for querying data\, generating reports\, and performi
 ng operations—no deep technical knowledge needed. You’ll see how this opens
  database access to a broader audience and helps bridge collaboration betwe
 en developers and non-developers.\n\nThe combined effect of these technolog
 ies is poised to revolutionize database development and interaction. Togeth
 er\, they are transforming how teams build\, access\, and collaborate aroun
 d data.\n\nJoin from PC\, Mac\, iPad\, or Android:\nhttps://oracle.zoom.us/
