CREATED:20250715T161827Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><p>Are you ready to supercharge your Google Ads campaigns an
 d unlock the full potential of AI for marketing? Join our AI Summer Bootcam
 p focused on performance\, and designed for growth-oriented marketing leade
 rs and specialists who demand more from their digital spend.<br /><br />In 
 today's rapidly evolving digital landscape\, AI isn't just an option &ndash
 \; it's the engine driving marketing success. By 2027\, AI-enabled advertis
 ing is projected to account for 90% of all advertising\, and early adopters
  are already seeing significant gains. This bootcamp will equip you with th
 e advanced strategies and practical insights to harness Google's latest AI 
 advancements for unparalleled campaign optimisation and superior ROI.<br />
 <br />Here's what to expect:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Master "The Power Pack"
 :</strong> Introducing our next generation of AI-powered campaign solutions
 \, built for this new era of Search and multi-modal experiences.<br /><br /
 ></li>\n<li><strong>Concrete Optimisation Best Practices: </strong>Get acti
 onable examples for enhancing your campaigns\, including advanced setup tec
 hniques\, crucial measurement foundations\, and creative strategies that tr
 uly resonate.<br /><br /></li>\n<li><strong>Unleash Value-Based Bidding:</s
 trong> Move beyond traditional bidding. Understand how to integrate custome
 r value into your Smart Bidding strategies to maximise conversion value and
  align directly with your business's profitability goals.<br /><br /></li>\
 n<li><strong>Navigate PMax with Confidence:</strong> Gain clarity on new ch
 annel reporting features\, best practices for full creative asset coverage\
 , and powerful features like URL expansion and New Customer Acquisition (NC
 A) goals.<br /><br /></li>\n<li><strong>Optimise Broad Match with AI:</stro
 ng> Discover how Google AI transforms Broad Match into a powerful tool for 
 capturing untapped queries and expanding reach\, all while maintaining effi
 ciency.<br /><br /></li>\n<li><strong>Q&amp\;A and Expert Insights: </stron
 g>Get your questions answered on leveraging Google AI for enhanced campaign
  performance and gain a comprehensive overview of account campaign setup an
 d critical insights.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Learn how to strategically partner wit
 h Google AI to capture more demand\, acquire high-value customers\, and ach
 ieve your most ambitious marketing objectives. Register now and secure your
  spot for this AI Summer Bootcamp on Performance.</p></p>\n<p>Join session 
 <a href="https://accelerate.google/intl/en/library/google-ai-summer-bootcam
 p-unleash-the-power-of-ai-to-boost-marketing-performance-day-2-jul?utm_sour
 ce=event_download&amp\;utm_medium=calendar" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
 here</a></p>\n<p>If you have any questions\, please contact <a href="mailto
 :questions-accelerate-with-google-emea@google.com" target="_blank" rel="noo
 pener">questions-accelerate-with-google-emea@google.com</a></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250715T161827Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Google - Google AI Summer Bootcamp: Unleash the Power of AI to Boos
 t Marketing Performance
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20250717T090000Z
DTEND:20250717T100000Z
DTSTAMP:20251031T072219Z
UID:0mv6783drv59169u144ae7eha0@google.com
CREATED:20250716T140129Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><p><span data-sheets-root="1">In today's rapidly evolving di
 gital landscape\, staying ahead means embracing the future of advertising\,
  especially when it comes to video. This AI Summer Bootcamp is designed to 
 give you the upper hand\, helping you fine-tune your Google and YouTube Ads
  strategy. We'll be leveraging cutting-edge Google AI to dramatically impro
 ve your campaign performance and really boost your ROI\, specifically throu
 gh the unbeatable reach and engagement of video content.<br /><br />We will
  guide you through the entire customer journey - covering every critical st
 age from building initial brand awareness to driving measurable action\, al
 l powered by strategic video campaigns. Our agenda will specifically delve 
 into Driving Brand Awareness with Video Reach Campaigns (VRC)\, Gaining Bra
 nd Consideration with Video View Campaigns (VVC)\, and Creating &amp\; Conv
 erting Demand with Demand Gen Campaigns\, ensuring you're equipped with the
  knowledge and tools to succeed in the AI-driven video advertising era.<br 
 /><br />Here's what to expect:<br /></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-sheet
 s-root="1"><strong>Driving Brand Awareness with Video Reach Campaigns (VRC)
 </strong>: Master the art of maximising unique reach and ensuring your comp
 lete video message is delivered at the ideal frequency. You'll learn how Go
 ogle AI intelligently selects video ad formats and placements (including in
 -stream\, in-feed\, and Shorts) for unparalleled awareness lift\, leading t
 o 54% more reach\, 42% lower costs\, and 40% higher ROAS on average. You'll
  also discover how mixing video formats via automation helps reduce redunda
 ncy in reach and how target frequency mixes can lead to 6% lower Cost Per M
 ille (CPMs) and an 11% higher likelihood of achieving frequency targets whe
 n combining Bumpers and Skippable in-stream ads.<br /><br /></span></li>\n<
 li><span data-sheets-root="1"><strong>Gaining Brand Consideration with Vide
 o View Campaigns (VVC)</strong>: Elevate your brand's presence and drive de
 eper connections through compelling video content. Explore how VVCs leverag
 e Google AI to maximise video views across skippable in-stream\, in-feed\, 
 and Shorts inventory at a single cost-per-view bid. Experience AI-driven re
 sults like 40% more views\, 30% lower CPVs\, 25% higher search lift\, and 4
 0% higher consideration lift\, focusing on creating deeper connections at s
 cale and boosting video/channel engagement. You'll also learn the power of 
 adding vertical video to ad groups for significantly increased views and Vi
 ew Through Rate (VTR) on Shorts.<br /><br /></span></li>\n<li><span data-sh
 eets-root="1"><strong>Creating &amp\; Converting Demand with Demand Gen Cam
 paigns</strong>: Unlock the full potential of Google and YouTube's vast tou
 chpoints to generate and convert demand effectively\, emphasising the syner
 gy of video and other visual formats. Understand how this powerful upgrade 
 from Video Action Campaigns (VACs) combines video and image ads\, offers ad
 vanced bidding strategies (including Target ROAS)\, and utilises generative
  AI tools to find untapped audiences and drive tangible conversions. Discov
 er best practices for creatives\, including using video and image together 
 across all aspect ratios\, and how AI tools assist in generating and modify
 ing ad images for enhanced visual appeal and scalability.</span></li>\n</ul
 >\n<p><span data-sheets-root="1">Don't miss out on this essential opportuni
 ty to master AI-driven video advertising including a dedicated Q&amp\;A ses
 sion on Video &amp\; Display. &nbsp\;Transform your campaigns\, boost your 
 performance\, and secure your spot.<br /></span></p></p>\n<p>Join session <
 a href="https://accelerate.google/intl/en/library/google-ai-summer-bootcamp
 -unlock-success-on-youtube-with-ai-for-video-advertising-day-3-jul?utm_sour
 ce=event_download&amp\;utm_medium=calendar" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
 here</a></p>\n<p>If you have any questions\, please contact <a href="mailto
 :questions-accelerate-with-google-emea@google.com" target="_blank" rel="noo
 pener">questions-accelerate-with-google-emea@google.com</a></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250716T140129Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Google - Google AI Summer Bootcamp: Unlock Success on YouTube with 
 AI for Video Advertising
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
