UID:2uech3iciq5s3q4c4hijbvvjqa@google.com
CREATED:20250805T215111Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><p><span data-sheets-root="1">Join us for the next edition o
 f Accelerate with Google\, where we'll unlock the power of Generative AI fo
 r your Google Ads campaigns. Discover the latest GenAI tools available dire
 ctly within your Google Ads accounts\, designed to help both customers and 
 agencies optimise performance.<br /></span></p>\n<p><span data-sheets-root=
 "1">But that's not all! Our Google Cloud team will then unveil how the cutt
 ing-edge Veo 3 AI model can revolutionise your video creative production\, 
 making it faster\, smarter\, and more impactful. To cap it off\, hear direc
 tly from one of our agency partners as they share real-world success storie
 s of deploying winning video campaigns using GenAI tools.<br /></span></p>\
 n<p><span data-sheets-root="1">What you'll learn:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><sp
 an data-sheets-root="1">How to leverage GenAI tools within Google Ads for e
 nhanced campaign performance.</span></li>\n<li><span data-sheets-root="1">T
 he transformative capabilities of Google Cloud's VEO AI model for video cre
 ative.</span></li>\n<li><span data-sheets-root="1">Practical insights and p
 roven strategies from an agency partner on GenAI-powered video campaigns.</
 span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span data-sheets-root="1"><a href="https://docs.goog
 le.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd1rftBn2DS4f2xhLEIhBonL3ol2skcJOLN5NOIQ6NNJjYQqQ/v
 iewform" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Submit your question here</a> for a
  chance to have them addressed during the live Q&amp\;A.&nbsp\;</span></p><
 /p>\n<p>Join session <a href="https://accelerate.google/intl/en/library/sup
 ercharge-your-google-ads-creatives-with-veo-3-aug?utm_source=event_download
 &amp\;utm_medium=calendar" target="_blank" rel="noopener">here</a></p>\n<p>
 If you have any questions\, please contact <a href="mailto:questions-accele
 rate-with-google-emea@google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">questions-
 accelerate-with-google-emea@google.com</a></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250805T215112Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Google - Supercharge Your Google Ads Creatives with Veo 3 and other
  GenAI tools
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
