DESCRIPTION:Registration required\; capacity limited.\n\nWelcome to the Acc
 elerate AI with Cloud Run workshop! This hands-on program is your guide to 
 transforming AI prototypes into secure\, scalable\, and robust production-g
 rade applications. While a great idea is the first step\, this workshop tac
 kles the real challenge: preparing your AI applications for real-world dema
 nds.\n\nThis is an interactive session\, not a lecture. Get ready for a ser
 ies of live labs where you will address real-world challenges\, from securi
 ng services to deploying advanced AI agents. You will leave with the practi
 cal skills and confidence to elevate your own AI projects.\n\nNote: To part
 icipate in the Codelab\, you must bring your own laptop and power cable. Th
 e activities are designed for laptops and cannot be completed on a tablet o
 r phone.
LAST-MODIFIED:20250915T202654Z
LOCATION:Google Chicago - Fulton Market\, 320 N Morgan St\, Suite 600\, Chi
 cago\, 60607\, US
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Accelerate AI with Cloud Run - Chicago
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
