DESCRIPTION:<p><p>Ready to see what&rsquo\;s next? Join us virtually on Oct
 ober 9th for Google Ads Demo Slam where we'll unveil new Google Ads and You
 Tube betas powered by AI. This is your sneak peek into the future of advert
 ising and an opportunity to get hands-on with tools that will change the wa
 y you work.</p>\n<p>In this session\, you&rsquo\;ll have the chance to:</p>
 \n<ul>\n<li><strong>Innovate with AI:</strong> Watch demos and discover how
  the latest AI-driven betas are set to revolutionize your campaigns and dri
 ve results.</li>\n<li><strong>Get Exclusive Access:</strong> Have the chanc
 e to sign up for cutting-edge betas before they're widely released.</li>\n<
 li><strong>Ask the Experts:</strong> Get answers to your most pressing ques
 tions by the Google product specialists who built these tools.</li>\n</ul>\
 n<p>Don&rsquo\;t miss this opportunity to unlock the latest AI innovations 
 and betas. Secure your spot today and be at the forefront of what's possibl
 e.</p>\n<p><span data-sheets-root="1"><a href="https://docs.google.com/form
 s/d/e/1FAIpQLSdCIG8Uj3fnY0-oLqfIh-YU2Y899pIN9LpVW8lt6QrgRi34nw/viewform" ta
 rget="_blank" rel="noopener">Submit your questions here</a> for a chance to
  have them addressed during the live Q&amp\;A.</span></p></p>\n<p>Join sess
 ion <a href="https://accelerate.google/intl/en/library/google-ads-demo-day-
 9-oct?utm_source=event_download&amp\;utm_medium=calendar" target="_blank" r
 el="noopener">here</a></p>\n<p>If you have any questions\, please contact <
 a href="mailto:questions-accelerate-with-google-emea@google.com" target="_b
 lank" rel="noopener">questions-accelerate-with-google-emea@google.com</a></
 p>
