DESCRIPTION:Event link: https://www.googlecloudevents.com/gemini-at-work\n\
 nAre you making the most of AI right now? Join Google Cloud’s CEO\, Thomas 
 Kurian for a live stream on Thursday\, 9 October 2025 at 6:00 PM BST / 7:00
  PM CET to learn new ways to put Gemini to work for your organization. And 
 hear from leaders around the world about how Gemini is transforming work fo
 r their industries.\nThis event is your opportunity to:\n- Get a front-row 
 seat to the newest innovations. Join us as we announce new Gemini innovatio
 ns designed to make you a force multiplier\, and bring the best of AI to yo
 ur business.\n- Get inspired by the success of over 100 customers. Learn fr
 om real-world examples how businesses\, large and small\, around the world 
 are putting Gemini to work.\n- Take action. Watch live demos\, discover how
  to deploy AI responsibly\, and learn how to keep your business secure\, fr
 om the data you use to the apps you build.\nSee you there!\nEvent link: htt
 ps://www.googlecloudevents.com/gemini-at-work
LAST-MODIFIED:20250930T080409Z
LOCATION:Online event
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Gemini at Work: AI that works for you.
TRANSP:OPAQUE
