CREATED:20251011T113701Z
DESCRIPTION:Are you making the most of AI right now? \n\nJoin Google Cloud’
 s CEO\, Thomas Kurian\, and industry leaders for a live stream on October 9
 \, 2025\, from 10 - 10:45 AM PT to learn new ways to put Gemini to work for
  your organization.\n\n(✓) Get a front-row seat to the newest innovations. 
 Join us as we announce new solutions designed to make you a force multiplie
 r\, and bring the best of AI to your business.\n(✓) Get inspired by the suc
 cess of over 100 customers. Learn from real-world examples of how businesse
 s\, large and small\, around the world are putting Gemini to work.\n(✓) Tak
 e action. Watch live demos\, discover how to deploy AI responsibly\, and le
 arn how to keep your business secure\, from the data you use to the apps yo
 u build.\n\nDon’t wait to unlock the full potential of your business.
LAST-MODIFIED:20251011T113701Z
LOCATION:Online
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Gemini at Work – Live Stream Event
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
