UID:6hj3ac1lckpj0bb46lijab9k60ojcbb270q68bb26com2c1k6lh3ge3168@google.com
CREATED:20251011T113728Z
DESCRIPTION:As Generative AI (GenAI) accelerates software development\, org
 anizations face a critical question: How can they embed GenAI into applicat
 ion development and data pipelines without compromising on software quality
 \, data integrity\, or trust?\n\nJoin us for a LinkedIn Live session explor
 ing key insights from Deloitte’s latest research on engineering in the age 
 of GenAI. This discussion brings together insights from over 40 interviews 
 with industry leaders and data from Deloitte’s State of Generative AI surve
 ys. You’ll hear from Deloitte experts and tech leaders on how to navigate t
 his shift while keeping quality and trust at the forefront.
LAST-MODIFIED:20251011T113728Z
LOCATION:Online
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Navigating software engineering and data quality with Generative AI
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
