UID:71j34eb46krj4b9ncpgj0b9k61ijeb9o70sjebb274qjac9ncgr66dhk6k@google.com
CREATED:20251023T142817Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><p><span data-sheets-root="1">Search is changing faster than
  ever before. Generative AI is transforming the classic blue links into dir
 ect\, intelligent answers\, creating a new landscape for user discovery and
  brand interaction. This session is your essential briefing on what this me
 ans for your business.<br /><br />In this event we'll unpack the technology
 \, strategy\, and opportunity presented by AI in Google Search. You'll lear
 n how this evolution impacts user behavior and\, most importantly\, how to 
 adapt your advertising strategy to not just survive\, but thrive. We will f
 ocus on the new\, essential opportunities this creates for you to connect w
 ith customers in more powerful and direct ways.<br /><br />Key Takeaways:<b
 r />A clear overview of generative AI's role in today's Search experience.<
 br />Actionable insights for adapting your ad campaigns.<br />A forward loo
 k at the new frontier of customer discovery.<br /><br />Join us to navigate
  the changes and accelerate your brand's growth in the new era of search.</
 span></p></p>\n<p>Join session <a href="https://accelerate.google/intl/en/l
 ibrary/the-future-of-search-thriving-in-the-era-of-ai-powered-discovery-oct
 -cee?utm_source=event_download&amp\;utm_medium=calendar" target="_blank" re
 l="noopener">here</a></p>\n<p>If you have any questions\, please contact <a
  href="mailto:questions-accelerate-with-google-emea@google.com" target="_bl
 ank" rel="noopener">questions-accelerate-with-google-emea@google.com</a></p
 >
LAST-MODIFIED:20251023T142817Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Google - The Future of Search:  thriving in the era of AI-powered d
 iscovery
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
